WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.646
A track can become a different kind of instrument. Press D for a new track, then hold Menu and press pad sixteen.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:13.276
The top row chooses the machine: Kit, Sampler, Synth, or MIDI. Choose Sampler with pad fourteen.

3
00:00:13.276 --> 00:00:21.917
Shift Main opens Play. Pads one, three, and five play the same sample at different pitches. Replace it with your own sample when you're ready.

4
00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:28.633
To change an existing track, return to Sound. Hold Shift and Menu, then pad fifteen opens Choose machine.

5
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:37.636
Pad sixteen chooses MIDI. Sound now shows its channel and destination. A MIDI track needs a destination before its notes can play an instrument.

6
00:00:37.636 --> 00:00:44.926
For our next lesson, use Choose machine again and pick Kit with pad thirteen. We'll turn a loop into sounds on the pads.
